":"跑，奔跑","audio":"/audio/9c2a1b27a4f73bece693.mp3","entryId":"62343","definition":"为了不被追赶的对方抓住而快速逃走。","pronunciation":["다라나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/490c5bd1ccba5c323404.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62343-1-8-2","ko":"나 잡아 봐라!","zh":"来抓我呀！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"잡아","meaning":"抓，捕","explanation":"잡다：抓，捕；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잡아","audio":"/audio/cd01e0912f86aeaeb2e9.mp3"}},{"text":"봐라!","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；어라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐라","audio":"/audio/e5ea2e3c97b86f194395.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，捕","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"捉住放在手里。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/886da047939e9cb53898.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.769,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62343","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSense